Subject: [PATCH 01/18] New files added related to jenkins build.

---
 .github/workflows/jenkinsbuild.yaml      | 13 +++++++++++++
 env.bat                                  |  5 +++++
 scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit-python.hook |  2 +-
 3 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
